WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.070
(EXHALES SHARPLY)

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.510
-WOODY: Oh!
-(ALL LAUGHING)

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.470
So long, Forky.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.110
Forky?
Who's watching the doors?

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.430
(ENGINE STARTS)

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.390
REX: Go, go, go!
HAMM: Oh, boy.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.990
Oh, my goodness. The awning.
What is going on?

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:22.430
(LAUGHING)

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.470
Does this mean
Woody's a lost toy?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.750
He's not lost.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.990
Not anymore.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:45.190
To infinity...

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.110
And beyond.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.430
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.230
Yay!

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.150
(SIGHS) There goes
another one.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.950
We're never
getting outta here.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.230
Psst. Frog legs.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.470
Up here, Rainbow Connection.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:56.070
You Mr. Toads wanna take
a wild ride with a kid?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.190
We can make that happen.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:58.750
-You can?
-Really?

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.350
Oh, yeah!
Leave it to us, Jeremiah.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.150
-GIRL: Aw.
-(DINGING)

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:10.750
(LAUGHS)

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.790
(CHILDREN CHATTERING
EXCITEDLY)

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.750
-(DINGING)
-(CHILDREN LAUGHING)

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.190
All right. Nice job, gang!

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.670
Every prize with a kid.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.230
-What's next?
-Leave that to us.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.190
-We know exactly what to do.
-DUCKY: Mmm-hmm.

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:17.270
(LIGHTS BUZZING)

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.790
(YAWNS)

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.710
-BOTH: Plush Rush!
-(AXEL SCREAMING)

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.390
DUCKY: How you like that, huh?

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:33.310
You got plush-rushed, son!

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.670
-Dance!
-(AXEL WHIMPERING)

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:35.950
(DUCKY LAUGHING)

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:37.470
Dance! Get those knees up!

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.550
-(LAUGHING)
-(WHIMPERING)

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.310
Let's see those feet move!
Whoo!

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.230
(BUNNY LAUGHING)

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.830
(AXEL SCREAMING)

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.790
-(DUCKY GROWLING)
-(IMITATING LASER FIRING)

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.990
Or we can get more toys
to kids.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.830
Yeah, let's do that.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.150
Do you really have laser eyes?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.190
Yeah.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.630
Whoa.

